Comment: The licence text below is a transcription of the LICENSE file at the
 top of the upstream source tree, reformatted for this file's syntax and not
 reworded. LICENSE is what `make install` puts in
 /usr/share/doc/satellite/copyright, and dh_installdocs puts this file at the
 same path in the package, so the two routes must state the same terms; check
 them against each other whenever either moves.

